Threads 8

# Method to solve the LP problem
LpMethod
-1 choose automatically (For Linear Programming, choose dual simplex method;)
1 dual simplex
2 barrier
3 crossover
4 concurrent
5 Choose between simplex and barrier automatically (Based on features such as sparsity and/or coefficients ranges).
6 PDLP

# determine automatically; not important for me
BarHomogeneous -1
BarOrder -1

# important since default is only 500
BarIterLimit 2000

# crossover: on/off
Crossover 1

# tolerances
FeasTol 1e-6
DualTol 1e-6

# "The relative gap of optimization." Chati claims that this refers merely to MIPs
RelGap 1e-4

# Logging
LogLevel 3

# time limit in seconds
TimeLimit 86400